          "title": "Incognito",
          "text": "I lived enough lives in Hommlet to know it inside out.\nI know their stories, their secrets, their buried and forgotten knowledge.\nThey have many tales of spirits, ghosts, goblins.\nMonsters in the mountains.\n\nBut nothing like me was ever here before.\nNobody in Hommlet ever heard of anything like me.\n\nI am not from here, it seems.\n\n[i]Permanent Upgrade [color=gold]Incognito[/color][/i]  \n+100% to all [icon=hommlet]Hommlet production",
